# AICC Builder Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values

# Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway web-search endpoint (Research & Contact Flow agents).
# Web search runs through a gateway authenticated with the ECS task role (SigV4) —
# no API key. Web Search on AgentCore is GA in us-east-1 only, so the gateway lives there.
#
# You normally DON'T set this: ./deploy.sh auto-creates the gateway (idempotently) via
# scripts/setup-web-search-gateway.sh and caches the resulting URL here. Set it only to
# point at a pre-existing gateway, or set ENABLE_WEB_SEARCH=false to skip web search.
# AGENTCORE_GATEWAY_URL=https://YOUR-GATEWAY-ID.gateway.bedrock-agentcore.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/mcp
